# error-key-unclosed-quote

## Input

```
"unterminated value

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..20
  ENTRY@0..20
    QUOTED_KEY@0..19
      DOUBLE_QUOTE@0..1 "\""
      STRING@1..19 "unterminated value"
    NEWLINE@19..20 "\n"
```

## Syntax Error

```
[
    SyntaxError {
        message: "missing closing quote",
        range: 0..19,
    },
]
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        Entry {
            key: QuotedKey {
                open_quote: DOUBLE_QUOTE@0..1 "\"",
                string: STRING@1..19 "unterminated value",
                close_quote: DOUBLE_QUOTE@0..1 "\"",
            },
            value: none,
        },
    ],
}
```

